<ContentLayout title="Privacy Policy | TokenCalculator.dev" description="TokenCalculator.dev privacy policy and local-processing commitment." heading="Privacy policy"><p>Your prompts, files, images, tokenization, and document extraction run in your browser. User content is never uploaded to TokenCalculator.dev or the public pricing catalog.</p><h2>Cookies and storage</h2><p>The site sets no cookies. It uses local browser storage only to remember your light or dark theme preference.</p><h2>Local files</h2><p>Document text and image dimensions exist only in the active browser session. Reloading or closing the page removes them.</p><h2>Public model metadata</h2><p>The browser may request public pricing and context-limit data from Models.dev. That request contains no prompt, token count, file, or image data.</p><h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The hosting provider may retain standard request metadata such as IP address, requested page, and browser user agent. User content is never part of those page requests.</p></ContentLayout>
